  "description": "Wooseung, an art student who's only now delving into the dating scene, falls head over heels for Sunjin, the ever-so-charming upperclassman. Imagine Wooseung dreaming up classic romantic scenes, only to find out Sunjin's idea of a relationship is... let's just say… more physical. And it’s not Sunjin's fault! He can't help it when Wooseung is just so freaking cute. From picture-perfect romantic dreams to Sunjin's hands-on approach, Wooseung's in for a wild ride!\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: includes 20 extra chapters. This work was first serialised in Lezhin before it got discontinued and moved to Series Naver. There is an adult version and a non-adult version.*",
